Copyright (C) 2026  Bob Tanner <tanner@real-time.com>

This project installs and configures ISC Kea v3 DHCP natively via apt packages
on Ubuntu Resolute (26.04 LTS). It is the second fork by the same author:

  ansible-role-kea-dhcp-docker Bob Tanner <tanner@real-time.com>
  https://github.com/basictheprogram/ansible-role-kea-dhcp-docker

  A Docker-based Ansible role for Kea DHCP, also authored by Bob Tanner,
  which adapted the original project for containerized deployment.

Neither fork is intended to be merged back into the upstream project.

